
CLOCK(1)            UNIX Programmer's Manual             CLOCK(1)

NAME
     clock - continually print the time of the day

SYNOPSIS
     clock

DESCRIPTION
     _C_l_o_c_k continually prints the time of day.

     A quit signal stops the clock; another quit restarts it.

BUGS
     _C_l_o_c_k must be run on a CRT.

     _C_l_o_c_k is monotonous.

